{"fps": 30, "frames": 1707, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 149, "text": "In March two thousand, the market priced a profitable business below zero.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 8, "e": 12}, {"w": "March", "f": 13, "e": 23}, {"w": "two", "f": 23, "e": 29}, {"w": "thousand,", "f": 30, "e": 47}, {"w": "the", "f": 47, "e": 54}, {"w": "market", "f": 54, "e": 66}, {"w": "priced", "f": 67, "e": 78}, {"w": "a", "f": 79, "e": 82}, {"w": "profitable", "f": 82, "e": 101}, {"w": "business", "f": 101, "e": 116}, {"w": "below", "f": 117, "e": 127}, {"w": "zero.", "f": 127, "e": 137}]}, {"a": 149, "b": 254, "text": "Imagine you own Three Com. It sells computer networks.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 151, "e": 164}, {"w": "you", "f": 165, "e": 171}, {"w": "own", "f": 172, "e": 178}, {"w": "Three", "f": 179, "e": 189}, {"w": "Com.", "f": 189, "e": 198}, {"w": "It", "f": 198, "e": 203}, {"w": "sells", "f": 203, "e": 213}, {"w": "computer", "f": 214, "e": 229}, {"w": "networks.", "f": 230, "e": 247}]}, {"a": 254, "b": 370, "text": "Inside it sits Palm, maker of the hottest handheld computer.", "words": [{"w": "Inside", "f": 256, "e": 268}, {"w": "it", "f": 268, "e": 273}, {"w": "sits", "f": 274, "e": 282}, {"w": "Palm,", "f": 282, "e": 292}, {"w": "maker", "f": 293, "e": 303}, {"w": "of", "f": 303, "e": 308}, {"w": "the", "f": 309, "e": 315}, {"w": "hottest", "f": 316, "e": 329}, {"w": "handheld", "f": 329, "e": 345}, {"w": "computer.", "f": 345, "e": 362}]}, {"a": 370, "b": 449, "text": "Three Com sells a sliver of Palm to the public.", "words": [{"w": "Three", "f": 372, "e": 380}, {"w": "Com", "f": 380, "e": 386}, {"w": "sells", "f": 386, "e": 395}, {"w": "a", "f": 395, "e": 398}, {"w": "sliver", "f": 398, "e": 408}, {"w": "of", "f": 408, "e": 412}, {"w": "Palm", "f": 413, "e": 420}, {"w": "to", "f": 420, "e": 424}, {"w": "the", "f": 425, "e": 430}, {"w": "public.", "f": 431, "e": 442}]}, {"a": 449, "b": 618, "text": "Palm rockets from thirty-eight dollars to one sixty-five, then close